<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head> 
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css">
    <title>User Post</title>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="heading-box">
        <h1>InkFlow</h1>
        <nav>
            <ul class="about">
                <li>Home</li>
                <li><a href="/public/about.html">About </a></li>
                <li><a href="/public/contact.html">Contact Me</a></li>
            </ul>
        </nav>
    </div>    
    <div class="container">
        <div class="aside">
            <ul class="aside-list">
                <li><a href="/public/index.html">Home</a></li>
                <li><a href="/public/index.html">Essays</a></li>
                <li><a href="https://www.paulgraham.com/books.html">Books</a> </li>      
                <li><a href="https://www.paulgraham.com/faq.html">FAQs</a></li>    
                <li><a href="https://www.paulgraham.com/quo.html">Quotes</a></li>  
                <li><a href="https://www.paulgraham.com/rss.html">RSS</a></li>  
                <li><a href="/public/about.html">Bio</a></li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="main">
            <h3>Essays</h3>
            <p>If you're not sure which to read, try these -</p>
            <ul class="essay-link">
                <li><a href="https://www.paulgraham.com/brandage.html">The Brand Age</a></li>
                <li><a href="https://www.paulgraham.com/goodwriting.html">Good Writing</a></li>
                <li><a href="https://www.paulgraham.com/do.html">What to do</a></li>
                <li><a href="https://www.paulgraham.com/greatwork.html">How to do great work</a></li>
                <li><a href="https://www.paulgraham.com/getideas.html">How to get new ideas</a></li>
                <li><a href="http://paulgraham.com/read.html">They need to read</a></li>
                <li><a href="https://www.paulgraham.com/words.html">Putting ideas into words</a></li>
                <li><a href="https://www.paulgraham.com/smart.html">Beyond Smart</a></li>
                <li><a href="https://www.paulgraham.com/alien.html">Alien Truth</a></li>
                <li><a href="https://www.paulgraham.com/hwh.html">How to work hard</a></li>
                <li><a href="https://www.paulgraham.com/fn.html">Fierce Nerds</a></li>
                <% posts.forEach(post => { %>
                    <li>
                            <a href="/post/<%= post.id %>">
                            🆕 <%= post.title %>
                        </a>
                    </li>
                <% }) %>
                <div class="post-controls"style=list-style:none> 
                    <button onclick="showForm()" class = "button-style"> Add Post</button>
                    <form id="postForm" action="/create" method="POST" style="display:none;">
                        <input type="text" name="title" placeholder="Title">
                
                        <textarea name="content" placeholder="Content"></textarea>
                
                        <button type="submit">Save</button>
                    </form>
                </div>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
    <script>
        function showForm() {
            document.getElementById("postForm").style.display = "block";
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>